            "detailed_description": "<strong>Quit your job to become an indie developer and make your first game!</strong><br><br>A short single-player 'clicker' game which tries to mimic the frantic feeling of being an indie developer; make your game while trying to stay healthy, social and earning enough money to pay the bills.<br><br><i>How will your game do when it releases?</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/3b65944832e13acc7a60c974b4182b88.poster.avif?t=1725185296\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/3b65944832e13acc7a60c974b4182b88.webm?t=1725185296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/3b65944832e13acc7a60c974b4182b88.mp4?t=1725185296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls/Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Left-click or Spacebar - to perform task<br></li><li> Right-click to switch task (Work on Game, Sleep, Earn Money, Fitness, Social) or quick switch using keyboard 1, 2, 3, 4, 5<br></li><li> Make sure you earn enough money to pay your bills!<br></li><li> Buy more items to make your life easier</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/6c802c32627aec42a09eda92a967827a.poster.avif?t=1725185296\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/6c802c32627aec42a09eda92a967827a.webm?t=1725185296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/6c802c32627aec42a09eda92a967827a.mp4?t=1725185296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/a4b9f47ef12cb9f9733c77c9b0715802.poster.avif?t=1725185296\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/a4b9f47ef12cb9f9733c77c9b0715802.webm?t=1725185296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/a4b9f47ef12cb9f9733c77c9b0715802.mp4?t=1725185296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/d2dbe39e451918d8aebdb500a5d8e4c4.poster.avif?t=1725185296\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/d2dbe39e451918d8aebdb500a5d8e4c4.webm?t=1725185296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/d2dbe39e451918d8aebdb500a5d8e4c4.mp4?t=1725185296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/fa6c57134a86c14cb53cd86dd55011c3.poster.avif?t=1725185296\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/fa6c57134a86c14cb53cd86dd55011c3.webm?t=1725185296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/fa6c57134a86c14cb53cd86dd55011c3.mp4?t=1725185296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>Quit your job to become an indie developer and make your first game!</strong><br><br>A short single-player 'clicker' game which tries to mimic the frantic feeling of being an indie developer; make your game while trying to stay healthy, social and earning enough money to pay the bills.<br><br><i>How will your game do when it releases?</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/3b65944832e13acc7a60c974b4182b88.poster.avif?t=1725185296\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/3b65944832e13acc7a60c974b4182b88.webm?t=1725185296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/3b65944832e13acc7a60c974b4182b88.mp4?t=1725185296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls/Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Left-click or Spacebar - to perform task<br></li><li> Right-click to switch task (Work on Game, Sleep, Earn Money, Fitness, Social) or quick switch using keyboard 1, 2, 3, 4, 5<br></li><li> Make sure you earn enough money to pay your bills!<br></li><li> Buy more items to make your life easier</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/6c802c32627aec42a09eda92a967827a.poster.avif?t=1725185296\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/6c802c32627aec42a09eda92a967827a.webm?t=1725185296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746520/extras/6c802c32627aec42a09eda92a967827a.mp4?t=1725185296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><